[assembly: AssemblyMetadata("LongDescription", "Independent Sony CrSDK camera plugin for N.I.N.A. Runtime capability checks, Sony Bayer RAW decoding, software Bulb, ISO/shutter control and JPEG LiveView where available. Sony A7 V (ILCE-7M5, firmware 2.00) is the hardware-validated model; other models are driven by the capabilities each body reports. Detects a user-downloaded Sony SDK at startup and imports it only from the explicit SDK setup page. No Sony SDK binaries are bundled. Developed with substantial AI assistance; the maintainer owns integration, validation and release decisions. Maintained by isky; not affiliated with Sony or N.I.N.A.")]
